        <ExplanationTxt>CONFLICT OF INTEREST. PART VI - GOVERANCE, MANAGEMENT, DISCLOSURE. ALL GOVERNING BOARD MEMBERS AND KEY EMPLOYEES ARE REQUIRED TO DISCLOSE THEIR FINANCIAL INFORMATION AND ANY POSSIBLE CONFLICTS OF INTEREST BY FILLING OUT FORM 700, WHICH IS THEN FILED IN THE COUNTY THAT THE ORGANIZATION CONDUCTS BUSINESS.</ExplanationTxt>
